{"type":"message","id":"bd64d029","parentId":"86d8e382","timestamp":"2026-03-27T06:32:57.734Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool_web_search_vV8zgYFh5i4Y61j0xYRM","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"ModelScope community API usage\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1061,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d58816050487310f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAPI Inference Usage Limits · Docs - modelscope.cn\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d58816050487310f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.modelscope.cn/docs/model-service/API-Inference/limits\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e67d0b14ba41b68\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAPI Inference Usage Limits API Inference Usage Limits ModelScope provides open-source models as a service through API Inference, standardizing them via API interfaces and offering them free of charge for developers to experience. For specific usage instructions, please refer to the . API Inference itself is a non-commercial, non-profit product.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e67d0b14ba41b68\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.modelscope.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"35256f48f2f853f4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nModelScope\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"35256f48f2f853f4\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://modelscope.ai/docs/openapi\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"57bd61784a365eb8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nModelScope——A one-stop service that brings together the most advanced machine learning models from various fields, offering model exploration experience, inference, training, deployment, and application.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"57bd61784a365eb8\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"modelscope.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0212da0f9c8656fd\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAPI Inference Introduction · Docs - ModelScope\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0212da0f9c8656fd\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://modelscope.ai/docs/model-service/API-Inference/intro\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dec13a0de0c46556\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOverview ModelScope provides open-source models as a service through API -Inference and standardizes them via API interfaces, enabling developers to experience open-source models in a more lightweight and agile manner and integrate them into various AI applications. This facilitates creative experimentation, including combining with tools to build diverse AI application prototypes.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dec13a0de0c46556\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"modelscope.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"519939d839ba10c1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGitHub - modelscope/modelscope: ModelScope: bring the notion of Model ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"519939d839ba10c1\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/modelscope/modelscope\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7e74df0eac9c1894\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nModelScope is built upon the notion of \\\"Model-as-a-Service\\\" (MaaS). It seeks to bring together most advanced machine learning models from the AI community , and streamlines the process of leveraging AI models in real-world applications. The core ModelScope library open-sourced in this repository provides the interfaces and implementations that allow developers to perform model inference ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7e74df0eac9c1894\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"g