w developers to perform model inference ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7e74df0eac9c1894\">>>","siteName":"github.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f5a260b335411723\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nModelScope API - Docs, SDKs & Integration\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f5a260b335411723\">>>","url":"https://apitracker.io/a/modelscope","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b60317679278df95\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nModelScope is built upon the notion of \"Model-as-a-Service\" (MaaS). It seeks to bring together most advanced machine learning models from the AI community , and streamlines the process of leveraging AI models in real-world applications.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b60317679278df95\">>>","siteName":"apitracker.io"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774593177733}}
{"type":"message","id":"27f058ae","parentId":"bd64d029","timestamp":"2026-03-27T06:32:59.648Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"关于魔搭社区（ModelScope）的API，根据我找到的信息，它提供了API推理服务，并且是免费向开发者开放的。你可以通过ModelScope的官方渠道（如其网站或文档）找到API的详细使用说明和接口。\n\n如果你找不到他们提供的API接口，我们可以尝试通过OpenClaw来使用魔搭社区的模型。OpenClaw可以集成多种模型和API服务。你需要告诉我你具体想使用魔搭社区的哪一个模型，然后我们可以看看如何将其接入OpenClaw。\n\n或者，你也可以直接访问[ModelScope的API文档](https://www.modelscope.cn/docs/model-service/API-Inference/limits)来查找API使用方法。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/auto","usage":{"input":1605,"output":151,"cacheRead":13369,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15125,"cost":{"input":-1605,"output":-151,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":-1756}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774593177734,"responseId":"gen-1774593177-QLWsOpku8g3GOgsciLC6"}}
