searching for \"footer\" in /app/docs.**Reviewing streaming documentation**\n\nI’m going to check /app/docs/concepts/streaming.md to see if there's any mention of \"footer.\" From what I’ve seen, it seems there’s no mention of it, although I did notice boundary semantics like \"text_end\" and \"message_end.\" So it looks like the footer in the user's configuration might not be recognized by the current version of OpenClaw. I should respond to the user by confirming that their attempt to configure streaming and a footer won’t have any effect since it's not supported.**Providing updated configuration and steps**\n\nLet’s start by recommending a correct configuration snippet for the user's OpenClaw settings. It would look like this:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"streaming\": true,\n      \"blockStreaming\": true,\n      \"blockStreamingBreak\": \"text_end\",\n      \"textChunkLimit\": 2000,\n      \"mediaMaxMb\": 30,\n      \"typingIndicator\": true,\n      \"resolveSenderNames\": true\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nNext, I can suggest ensuring the Feishu channel is active by checking gateway status and logs. I should clarify that the \"footer\" is not officially recognized unless it’s part of a newer version. The \"footer\" content won't appear in the current settings. We may need to move it to \"agents.defaults.footer\" if that config exists.\n\nI’ll ask the user if they would like me to make adjustments to ensure streaming works and inquire about the specific OpenClaw version they’re using. This way, we can provide tailored assistance!","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"简要答复：\n\n- 你给的配置里，Feishu 的流式输出相关选项是有效的：streaming、blockStreaming、blockStreamingBreak 等都属于 OpenClaw 的流式/分块机制。\n- 但在官方文档里并没有“footer”作为 Feishu 配置的标准字段。也就是说，footer: { status: true, elapsed: true } 可能不会生效，或需要在更高层级（如 agents.defaults）才有定义。\n\n建议的整理和测试思路：\n\n- 将 Feishu 的配置简化为官方支持的字段，例如：\n  {\n    c