{"type":"message","id":"4acae0c7","parentId":"f7a4ddb9","timestamp":"2026-03-27T09:55:58.912Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering model switch limitations**\n\nThe user wants to switch to Google Gemini-2.5-flash, but I ran into some errors while trying to start a session with subagent and ACP. It looks like I'll need to explain these limitations and suggest alternative steps for switching models in this environment. Since we're using OpenClaw with the Feishu channel, I might need to proceed with a simpler approach, like using a non-threaded session for Gemini and ensuring the necessary parameters are properly set.**Exploring model switch options**\n\nThe error indicates that ACP thread spawning isn't supported in Feishu, which restricts my options. I can try spawning a standard \"subagent\" runtime with a \"session\" mode. However, there was a previous issue with streamTo; it works for ACP. Alternatively, I could suggest switching the model by updating the global configuration. If the user wants Google Gemini 2.5, I might propose setting the active model in this session using a directive to \"set model google/gemini-2.5-flash,\" assuming the system allows it.**Clarifying model switching limitations**\n\nIt seems the tool doesn’t have a direct \"set model\" option in this API, only allowing runtime spawning with ACP or subagent. However, in the Feishu environment, it looks like Gemini 2.5 might not be supported due to limitations. I should explain these constraints and offer alternatives, like switching to zai/glm-5 or using google/gemini-2.5-flash without threads. The proposed steps could involve using global config to set the model and updating through \"openclaw.\" Let's keep it clear and concise!**Suggesting alternative steps for switching**\n\nThe user asked to switch models, but my attempt with the tool failed. I need to report this and propose next steps. Unfortunately, Feishu doesn't support ACP thread spawning, so I'll suggest two paths instead. We can perform a global config update using manual commands to set the model to google/gemini-2.5-flash and restart OpenClaw. If that's not feasible, I can recommend using \"zai/glm-5\" as a safer default or switching to the \"openrouter/auto\" bridging configuration.**Proposing model switch options**\n\nI acknowledge that switching to google/gemini-2.5-flash failed due to constraints in the Feishu channel, which doesn't support ACP thread spawning. We can offer two options: First, I can apply a global config update to set the default model to google/gemini-2.5-flash—I'll provide the config snippet and modifications steps. Alternatively, if you prefer per-session overrides, we can wait until channel support improves. Would you like me to proceed with the global switch?","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"当前不能按你请求的方式在 Feishu 频道进行“按会话切换模型”的操作。我尝试创建 ACP 子会话来加载 google/gemini-2.5-flash，但 Feishu 的绑定不支持 ACP 线程/分支启动，也不能用带 streamTo 的子进程模式。因此，无法按单个会话切换到该模型。\n\n可行的落地路径（全局生效）：\n- 把默认模型改为 google/gemini-2.5-flash，并保持流式/尾部信息选项。这样新建的会话都会使用该模型。步骤如下：\n  1) 找到并编辑 OpenClaw 全局配置（常见位置示例）：\n     - /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n     - /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/config/openclaw.json\n  2) 将默认模型设置为 google/gemini-2.5-flash，保留流式与 footer：\n     {\n       \"agents\": {\n         \"defaults\": {\n           \"model\": \"google/gemini-2.5-flash\",\n           \"streaming\": true,\n           \"footer\": { \"status\": true, \"elapsed\": true }\n         }\n       }\n     }\n  3) 保存后重启 OpenClaw：\n     openclaw restart\n  4) 通过简单对话测试切换是否生效。\n\n- 如果你愿意，我也可以给出精准的命令行片段，前提是你告诉我你当前配置文件的实际路径（我可以基于你实际路径给出 jq 修改命令）。\n\n你要不要让我按上述方式进行全局切换（google/gemini-2.5-flash），并在切换后帮你测试一次？如果你更倾向于维持当前会话不变，也可以继续使用现有模型，我再按你的指示继续。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/auto","usage":{"input":216,"output":4067,"cacheRead":14464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18747,"cost":{"input":-216,"output":-4067,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":-4283}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774605334085,"responseId":"gen-1774605334-RuAaMUsIOfi2SDzSIm60"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e70cbb64","parentId":"4acae0c7","timestamp":"2026-03-27T11:59:20.953Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53535faf98a0ee8e65bbba99459\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_7fbbaf01c5420c84595f0bf5677fc808\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-03-27 11:59 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_7fbbaf01c5420c84595f0bf5677fc808)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_7fbbaf01c5420c84595f0bf5677fc808\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53535faf98a0ee8e65bbba99459]\n听风: Openclaw.json配置文件一个gateway只能有一个吧"}],"timestamp":1774612760950}}
{"type":"message","id":"7c032e56","parentId":"e70cbb64","timestamp":"2026-03-27T11:59:36.845Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying OpenClaw configuration**\n\nThe user is asking if an OpenClaw configuration file can have only one gateway. It seems they're curious about the gateway setup in the OpenClaw environment, specifically in the openclaw.json file. \n\nIn OpenClaw, it’s typically possible to configure multiple gateway blocks, forming a list in the JSON structure. I think I should guide the user towards this potential but avoid giving inaccurate details, focusing instead on the general configuration format.**Explaining the gateway concept**\n\nThe user is asking whether a gateway can only have one instance in the configuration. The question suggests that the gateway might connect to a model provider. \n\nIt seems like the answer can vary based on the architecture. You can have multiple gateways in the configuration or a single gateway that defines multiple channels within it. I'll clarify that a single gateway instance can connect to different providers. Since there are no specific documents available, I'll provide this general guidance about multiple gateways and channels.**Clarifying gateway configuration options**\n\nTo avoid misinformation, I should clarify some points about gateways. \n\nTypically, you can configure multiple gateways in the OpenClaw configuration by listing them separately, which allows for using different providers simultaneously. A single gateway typically represents one endpoint. If switching providers is needed mid-session, creating separate gateway entries or sub-sessions might work.\n\nI should suggest checking the openclaw.json file for relevant fields like \"gateways,\" \"gateway,\" or \"provider.\" If that doesn't help, I can ask the user to share their config snippet for more personalized guidance.**Responding to gateway configuration inquiry**\n\nIn response to the user's question about gateways, I can explain that it depends on the setup. You can have multiple gateways, but typically, a single gateway instance connects to one upstream provider. If multiple providers are needed, you can either configure several gateways or consider a multi-gateway setup if supported.\n\nI should suggest that they paste their openclaw.json snippet for analysis. Additionally, I can mention the option of running multiple gateway processes or using one gateway with multiple providers, depending on the configuration.**Crafting a response for gateway configurations**\n\nI want to start by answering the user's question directly: Not necessarily! You can have multiple gateways configured, but typically, each entry targets one upstream provider. To support multiple providers, you’d either create separate entries or use a gateway that allows multiple channels if the configuration supports it. \n\nI should recommend checking the current schema. For further assistance, I can ask the user to paste their openclaw.json snippet so I can provide exact advice on the configuration structure.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"简短回答：不一定。一个网关通常指向一个上游服务，但配置里是否能放多条网关取决于你使用的 OpenClaw 版本和配置/schema。\n\n可选方案：\n- 方案A：在配置里为不同提供方各自定义一个网关（多网关配置），实现对不同模型/提供方的并行接入。\n- 方案B：如果版本支持，在同一个网关内通过多通道/多目标来接入多个提供方；需要看你当前的配置结构是否支持。\n\n怎么确认和操作：\n- 查看你当前的 openclaw.json 是否包含 gateways 或 gateway 字段，以及是否存在 providers/channels 等聚合字段。\n- 如果只有一个 gateway，而你想要多提供方，通常需要新增多个 gateway 条目（或通过复制并修改现有网关段）。\n- 如果你愿意，把你现有的 openclaw.json 片段贴给我，我可以给出精准的修改建议和执行命令。\n\n需要我帮你分析你当前的配置并给出具体的修改步骤吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/auto","usage":{"input":15314,"output":2689,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18003,"cost":{"input":-15314,"output":-2689,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":-18003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774612760953,"responseId":"gen-1774612761-7xc0Y3JOKJUz3EkvjpBX"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6e24e694","parentId":"7c032e56","timestamp":"2026-03-27T15:58:07.936Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b535ede119ca0ee70899c64e33b6\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_7fbbaf01c5420c84595f0bf5677fc808\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-03-27 15:58 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_7fbbaf01c5420c84595f0bf5677fc808)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_7fbbaf01c5420c84595f0bf5677fc808\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b535ede119ca0ee70899c64e33b6] 听风: \\- google/gemini\\-2.5\\-flash:free"}],"timestamp":1774627087934}}
{"type":"message","id":"d31a7639","parentId":"6e24e694","timestamp":"2026-03-27T15:58:25.048Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Crafting concise steps**\n\nI want to finalize this by providing clear, concise steps for the user. It’s important to be straightforward and helpful. I also want to offer to apply the patch if needed, making sure the user knows I'm here to assist them further. It's all about ensuring my answer is useful while avoiding any unnecessary tool calls to keep things simple. Let’s make it easy for them to follow along!","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，你要用 google/gemini-2.5-flash:free。这个模型是受支持的，可以放在全局默认，以便新会话都使用它。\n\n落地方案（两种路径，优先全局切换）：\n\n1) 全局默认切换（最稳妥）\n- 找到 OpenClaw 全局配置文件，常见路径可能是：\n  - /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n  - /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/config/openclaw.json\n- 修改 defaults 里的模型为 google/gemini-2.5-flash，同时保留 streaming/footer：\n  {\n    \"agents\": {\n      \"defaults\": {\n        \"model\": \"google/gemini-2.5-flash\",\n        \"streaming\": true,\n        \"footer\": { \"status\": true, \"elapsed\": true }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n- 保存后重启 OpenClaw：\n  - openclaw restart\n- 测试对话，确认新会话使用新模型。\n\n2) 会话级覆盖（若你的界面支持）\n- 如果 Feishu/当前界面允许单独会话切换模型，请告诉我你使用的界面版本，我给出精确的命令或步骤。当前在 Feishu 上尝试直接切换通常受限，需通过全局配置实现。\n\n要不要我直接给出针对你实际配置文件的精确修改命令？如果你愿意，请把你当前 openclaw.json 的相关片段贴给我，我会生成一行一行的替换命令。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/auto","usage":{"input":15770,"output":2673,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18443,"cost":{"input":-15770,"output":-2673,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":-18443}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774627087936,"responseId":"gen-1774627088-omFOBYaIVmYmVyyMkL5d"}}
